// Weekdays computed 2026-10-16: Tuesday, December 8; Saturday, December 12; Monday, December 14; Tuesday, December 15; Wednesday, December 16; Thursday, December 17; Monday, December 21; Wednesday, December 23; Friday, December 25, 2026; Monday, January 4 and Saturday, January 9, 2027. Sunday, October 28 and Monday, October 29, 2007; Tuesday, June 3, 2008.
// Gene's notebook ("boy?" in the margin, "cap" struck out) is planted here per the reveal schedule; Luis's station question closes the chapter.
